hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17739","Ibrahim ibn Ishaq narrated to us, Abdullah ibn al-Mubarak narrated to us, from Yahya ibn Hassan, of the people of Jerusalem, and he was an old shaykh of good understanding, from Rabia ibn Amir who said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: Persist with: O Possessor of Majesty and Honor."
